<title>JAPAN: OSE says will extend futures, options trading time.</title>
<headline>OSE says will extend futures, options trading time.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Tuesday that it will extend the trading time for Nikkei 225 futures and options by 10 minutes.</p>
</text>
